# Avocado build state — generated per build, never commit these.
# Matches in every reference directory (patterns without a slash apply recursively).
# NB: avocado.lock is intentionally NOT ignored — it's a tracked pin file. The
# build-check script strips maintainers' local lockfiles before commit instead.
.avocado-desktop.json
.avocado/
.avocado-state